 class=\"item-date\">2026-07-21</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\">Repo Map Enhancements</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Repo map now tags Fortran, Haskell, Julia, and Zig and is compatible with newer tree-sitter Python APIs. Enhanced language support for better code analysis.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"item-date\">2026-07-21</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Column -->\n            <section class=\"column technical-insights\" id=\"technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Technical Insights</div>\n                <div class=\"column-content\">\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EV7WhVT270Q\" target=\"_blank\">State of AI in 2026: LLMs, Coding, Scaling Laws, China, Agents, GPUs, AGI</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Comprehensive discussion covering the current state of AI in 2026, including topics like LLMs, coding, scaling laws, China, AI agents, GPUs, and AGI. This video provides insights into the latest developments and future directions of AI technology.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"insight-author\">Lex Fridman Podcast</span